<title>INDIA: Central Indian soybean markets closed Monday, Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Central Indian soybean markets closed Monday, Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>All major soybean markets of central India were closed today for the Hindu holiday Amavasya. Markets will be closed on Tuesday for local holidays.</p>
